        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 24 at 1:39PM AST by NWS San Juan PR</headline>
        <description>At 139 PM AST, Doppler radar was tracking an area of strong
thunderstorms over Hato Arriba, or over San Sebastian, moving
northwest at 10 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts up to 40 mph and frequent lightning. Funnel
clouds possible.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.
</description>
        <instruction>Monitor the weather situation closely and be alert for threatening
weather conditions.</instruction>
